# Queue (BullMQ)

- Heavy/long-running work (emails, exports, webhooks, thumbnails) must be offloaded to queue
- Do not run long jobs in HTTP request lifecycle; return `202 Accepted` or a job id
- Configure retries (3–5) with exponential backoff; define a dead-letter strategy
- Add monitoring (Bull Board / metrics) when queues are business-critical

